      "question": "Sensory functions",
      "preferredVariantId": "v-593bcbd306",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "v-593bcbd306",
          "answer": "Internal branch provides sensation above the vocal folds and forms an important afferent limb of the cough reflex.",
