      "question": "Lesion",
      "preferredVariantId": "v-f1c63767a5",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "v-f1c63767a5",
          "answer": "External branch injury causes reduced ability to produce high-pitched sounds and voice fatigue; internal branch injury reduces supraglottic sensation and the cough reflex, increasing aspiration risk.",
