              "sourceLine": 213
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "v-dd973302c8",
          "answer": "External branch injury causes loss of high-pitch control and voice fatigue; internal branch injury reduces supraglottic sensation and cough reflex, increasing aspiration risk.",
